Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(189.6,58.667)}Tooth-kun, I want to change my UFO's lights, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's this consultation about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking about finally changing my \NUFO's lights to LED, so I went to ask at the electronics store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they told me to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the brightness of LEDs differs from current lights, \Nso I have no idea what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no clue what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I feel like I've heard of that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, there are a few different types \Nof brightness/color temperatures, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. \NThat's why I consulted the electronics store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And they said they'd let me test them out, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For free?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! \NWhen I told them I wanted to replace all my UFO's lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they gladly agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was hoping I could get both \Nof your opinions on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,First is warm white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs30\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.2,101.333)}{\pos(193.6,102.4)}WARM WHITE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's relaxing and nice, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is neutral white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.93,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs28\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.2,101.333)}{\pos(193.6,102.4)} NEUTRAL WHITE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.34,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They say this is closest to natural light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great for cooking or putting on makeup, tsun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very well-informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, cool daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,, It has a slightly bluish tint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs27\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.2,101.333)}{\pos(193.6,102.4)} COOL DAYLIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it's good for when \Nyou're studying or focusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.68,0:01:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the third one looked the part and was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consult the higher-ups about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The upper teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The consideration of parking the UFO a bit further away \Nso as not to bother the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We should learn from that.
